# Material library for developer_portable.obj — referenced by its `mtllib`
# line. Without a `usemtl` binding in the OBJ every mesh bakes with a null
# material and the forge/neoforge OBJ loader emits zero quads.
# Texture slot #default is filled by model JSON "textures.default".
# Ka only matters when the model JSON enables emissive_ambient (it does not).
newmtl MainMaterial
Ka 1.000 1.000 1.000
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
Ks 0.000 0.000 0.000
d 1.0
map_Kd #default
